15
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.714
The public contract is what approved
clients may rely on.

16
00:01:20.714 --> 00:01:26.429
Keep identity, authorization, and policy
outside model prompts. Do not

17
00:01:26.429 --> 00:01:32.143
